Fonts that ZangbandTK brings with it
====================================

Five monospaced fonts, offered on the Display page beside the fonts the
system has: for the map, the text panes, and the isometric view's ASCII
style, which is drawn in the map's font.  ZangbandTK makes them its own
while it runs (src/tcl/fonts.c); nothing is installed on the system.

  JetBrains Mono    JetBrainsMono-Regular.ttf, -Bold.ttf   JetBrainsMono-OFL.txt
  IBM Plex Mono     IBMPlexMono-Regular.ttf, -Bold.ttf     IBMPlexMono-OFL.txt
  Source Code Pro   SourceCodePro-Regular.ttf, -Bold.ttf   SourceCodePro-OFL.md
  Space Mono        SpaceMono-Regular.ttf, -Bold.ttf       SpaceMono-OFL.txt
  Red Hat Mono      RedHatMono-Regular.ttf, -Bold.ttf      RedHatMono-OFL.txt

Each is under the SIL Open Font License, version 1.1, whose text and the
font's copyright are in the file beside it.  They are the fonts as their
authors publish them, unmodified:

  JetBrains Mono    github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono, fonts/ttf
  IBM Plex Mono     github.com/google/fonts, ofl/ibmplexmono
  Source Code Pro   github.com/adobe-fonts/source-code-pro, release/TTF
  Space Mono        github.com/google/fonts, ofl/spacemono
  Red Hat Mono      github.com/RedHatOfficial/RedHatFont, fonts/Mono/RedHatMono/ttf

Any .ttf or .otf put here is offered the same way.
